      "value": "<p><strong>Area Attack.</strong> Each creature within 6 squares rolls <strong>Resolve</strong> vs DC 15. Hit: <code>2d12</code> psychic (world-shuffle) + soul; half on success. Failed-save targets swap positions with the nearest other failed-save target (GM pairs them up). They are also Shaken until end of next turn.<br/><em>Recharges on a Soma Break.</em></p><p><em>The avatar gestures, briefly, and the rules of where things go stop being negotiable.</em></p>",
